window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Thrall. Dhamphyr. Empress.<br> <br> Each is a title that has been thrust upon me, but there’s another I’ll willingly claim for myself: Malakai’s executioner.<br> <br> He thought he could break me, twist me into his obedient pet–but all he has done is add to the list of reasons why I’ll find and kill him.</p> <p>Of course, it isn’t that simple, and I have made many promises that I have to uphold.</p> <p>To bring as many of our soldiers home to their families as possible.</p> <p>To free the citizens of Malakai’s empire of his oppression.</p> <p>To unite two empires under the mantles of freedom and equality.</p> <p>Will my ruthless love be enough to end this for good, all while staying true to those promises?</p> <p>It has to be.</p> <p>From the authors that brought you<i> Monarchs of Hell </i>and <i>Dark Imaginarium Academy....</i></p> <p><i>Ruthless Love</i> is the final audiobook in the Vampyres’ Source trilogy that features a strong-willed but wounded FMC, and her possessive Vampyre Lords that will topple empires for her freedom. Content is intended for mature audiences, featuring characters 18 plus. This audiobook includes violence and mature sexual content.</p>"; 
